rships minimum $300, 0.5% daily and 300% over 600 days, recruitment commissions down 20 levels, and migration encouragement to HyperNation. Guardian reports a promoter described HyperVerse and HyperNation as one big entity; Lee denied involvement in HyperNation and said he worked on funds management/technology side. Treat law-enforcement allegations as allegations, Guardian findings as journalistic verification, and celebrity knowledge as unproven."}
